    "🎉 %@（%@）" : {
      "comment" : "賀寿の名称とかな",
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "🎓 %@" : {
      "comment" : "学齢の名称",
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "アプリ内の文字の大きさを決めます。自動を選ぶと、iPhoneの「設定」→「画面表示と明るさ」→「テキストサイズ」に合わせて変わります。標準・大・特大を選ぶと、端末の設定に関わらずその大きさになります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sets the text size inside the app. Auto follows iPhone Settings → Display & Brightness → Text Size. Standard, Large, and Extra Large fix the size regardless of your device setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オンにすると、年に書いたメモは「自分」の一覧でだけ表示されます。年齢や名簿の一覧ではメモが隠れるため、他の人に画面を見せるときに便利です。オフにするとどの一覧でもメモが表示されます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the notes you write on a year appear only in the Myself list. They stay hidden in the Age and Roster lists, which is useful when showing your screen to someone else. When off, notes appear in every list."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キャンセル" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ここに自分の生年月日を登録すると、「自分」の一覧で各年に自分が何歳になるかが表示されます。生まれた年には目印が付きます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Save your date of birth here and the Myself list will show how old you are in each year. Your birth year is marked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この年に生まれました" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Born this year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この年の誕生日で満%lld歳" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turns %lld on the birthday this year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この年は数え%lld歳" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kazoedoshi age %lld this year"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "その年のカレンダーです。日付の下に六曜と月の満ち欠けを添えています。\n\n【六曜】\n先勝・友引・先負・仏滅・大安・赤口の6日周期で、旧暦の月日から求めます。日取りを選ぶときに探すことの多い大安は赤色で示します。\n\n【月の満ち欠け】\nパーセントは輝面率といい、月の光っている部分の面積の割合です。新月が0％、満月が100％になります。\n\n夕方から夜にかけて実際に空へ出ている月に合わせて計算しているので、その晩に見上げる月の姿とおおよそ一致します。満月（100％）は黄色で示します。\n\n旧暦をもとにした概算のため、実際の満月と1日ずれることがあります。\n\n【改元】\n改元があった年は、元号が変わる日に区切り線と新しい元号を表示します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The calendar for that year. Under each date you will find the rokuyo and the phase of the moon.\n\n[六曜 rokuyo]\nA six-day cycle — 先勝 senshō, 友引 tomobiki, 先負 senbu, 仏滅 butsumetsu, 大安 taian, 赤口 shakkō — derived from the lunisolar calendar. 大安, the day most often sought when choosing a date, is marked in red.\n\n[The moon]\nThe percentage is the illuminated fraction: how much of the moon's face is lit. A new moon is 0% and a full moon is 100%.\n\nIt is calculated for the moon as it actually stands in the sky from evening into night, so it matches roughly what you would see looking up that night. A full moon (100%) is marked in yellow.\n\nBecause it is an approximation based on the lunisolar calendar, it can be a day off from the true full moon.\n\n[Era changes]\nIn a year when the era changed, the day it changed is marked with a rule and the new era name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
