    "歳" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "満年齢は誕生日ごとに1つ増える、現在ふつうに使われている数え方です。数え年は生まれた時点で1歳とし、以後は元日ごとに1つ増える昔ながらの数え方で、年内では満年齢より1つ多くなります。還暦や喜寿などの長寿祝いは、もともと数え年で祝うものでした。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "満年齢 (man-nenrei) is the count used today: it goes up on each birthday, the same as in the West. 数え年 (kazoedoshi) is the traditional count: you are 1 at birth and everyone gains a year on New Year's Day, so it runs one ahead within the year. Longevity celebrations such as 還暦 (kanreki) and 喜寿 (kiju) were originally reckoned this way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "特大" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Extra Large"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "現在%lld歳の方の誕生年" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Birth year of someone now %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生まれるまであと%lld年" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld years before birth"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "生年月日をもとに、小学1年から大学4年までの学年を一覧に表示します。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uses the date of birth to show each grade from elementary school year 1 through university year 4."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "男性" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Male"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面の明るさの見た目を決めます。自動を選ぶと、iPhone本体のライトモード・ダークモードの設定に合わせて変わります。ライトまたはダークを選ぶと、端末の設定に関わらずその見た目に固定されます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sets the app's appearance. Auto follows your iPhone's Light or Dark Mode setting. Light or Dark fixes the appearance regardless of your device setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
